+/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
+/*                                                                            */
+/* WASM under Node: RexxAPI connections over a Unix domain socket, using      */
+/* Node's net module on the JS main thread.  The interpreter (and the rxapi   */
+/* daemon) run on pthreads; each operation is proxied to the main thread and  */
+/* the calling thread blocks until the asynchronous socket operation is done  */
+/* (emscripten_proxy_sync_with_ctx), so the protocol code and APIServer are   */
